# Act 1 — Arrival

## The Return

EXT. HOLLOW CREEK ROAD - DAY

A road that gave up being a road a mile back. MARCUS CADE walks it with a bag over one shoulder, coat too good for the country and too thin for the season.

He stops. Ahead, past the fence line, the farmhouse.

It is smaller than he has been remembering it. He stands with that a while.

Then he walks on.

INT. FARMHOUSE KITCHEN - DAY (ARRIVAL)

ELEANOR CADE is at the sink with her back to the door. She does not turn when it opens.

ELEANOR
Shut it behind you.

Marcus sets the bag down. He leaves the door where it is.

MARCUS
It's warm out.

ELEANOR
(still not turning)
It isn't.

She washes the same cup she has already washed. Behind her the door stands open on the yard, and neither of them closes it.

EXT. GRAVESIDE - DUSK

# Act 2 — The Thaw

## The Thaw

EXT. CREEK CROSSING - DAY

INT. FARMHOUSE KITCHEN - NIGHT (AFTER)

EXT. FARMHOUSE PORCH - DAY

## The Reckoning

INT. FARMHOUSE KITCHEN - NIGHT

One lamp. Eleanor at the table with Ada's shawl around her shoulders. Marcus in the doorway, coat still on.

ELEANOR
You came back.

MARCUS
I came back.

ELEANOR
Eleven years, and you come back for the part where there's nothing left to carry.

Marcus does not answer. His hand goes to his coat pocket and stops there.

ELEANOR
Say it or go to bed.

He goes to bed.

EXT. FARMHOUSE YARD - NIGHT (CUT)

Marcus crosses the yard to the truck and stands with his hand on the door. He does not open it.

INT. FARMHOUSE KITCHEN - NIGHT (LATER)

The lamp is out. Eleanor has not moved.

She sits in the dark with the shawl and the open door and the sound of the creek doing what it does.

# Act 3 — The Truth

INT. FARMHOUSE KITCHEN - NIGHT (CONFESSION)

The lamp again. Marcus has the locket out on the table between them, chain pooled beside it.

MARCUS
I was at the creek that day.

Eleanor looks at the locket. Not at him.

ELEANOR
I know.

MARCUS
You know.

ELEANOR
I've known since the day after. I've been waiting eleven years for you to be the one to say it.

INT. HOLLOW CREEK CHURCH - DAY

## The Storm

EXT. RIDGE FOREST - NIGHT (STORM)

## The Open Door

EXT. FARMHOUSE PORCH - DAWN
